2:T540,<h2><span class="ident">The Voice That Defines Christmas</span> Across the UK</h2>
<p>
From my <a href="/bbc-radio-2-voice-of-santa" class="isred" target="_blank" title="BBC Radio 2">BBC Radio 2</a> 
work with Zoe Ball to Christmas Day catch-ups on Capital, Santa on 
<a href="/this-morning-spin-to-win-gameshow-voice" class="isred" target="_blank" title="ITV">ITV’s This Morning</a>, 
and the GO Jetters on CBeebies, my Santa voice is heard nationwide every December.
<br>
With years of experience bringing Father Christmas to life, my voice has become one of the UK’s definitive 
sounds of Christmas. Authentic, warm, joyful, and instantly recognisable, no imitations here. Just the real, 
British Father Christmas voice trusted by major brands every year. If you enjoy this style, explore my full range of <a href="/character-voiceover" title="Character Voiceover" class="isred">character voices</a> too.
</p>


<!-- Mini Player Santa Voice -->
<div style="margin:20px 0;">
  <audio controls style="width:100%; max-width:420px;">
    <source src="/assets/audio/santa-voice-showreel-2025-guy-harris.mp3" type="audio/mpeg">
    Your browser does not support the audio element.
  </audio>
  <p style="font-size:0.9em; opacity:0.8; margin-top:5px;">
    Father Christmas & Santa Voice Showreel, Guy Harris
  </p>
</div>3:T638,<h2>Enjoy <span class="ident">Santa’s Free Apps</span></h2>
<p>
Why not download some of my free Christmas apps?  
Great for kids and families. Check out 
<a href="https://apps.apple.com/gb/app/santa-radio/id1021183593" target="_blank" 
   title="Santa Radio" rel="noopener noreferrer">Santa Radio</a>, 
<a href="https://apps.apple.com/gb/app/santa-text/id1024535991" target="_blank" 
   title="Santa Text" rel="noopener noreferrer">Santa Text</a>, 
<a href="https://apps.apple.com/gb/app/santa-messages/id1062532143" target="_blank" 
   title="Santa Messages" rel="noopener noreferrer">Santa Messages</a>, and 
<a href="https://apps.apple.com/gb/app/sleeps-to-santa/id949843943" target="_blank" 
   title="Sleeps til Santa" rel="noopener noreferrer">Sleeps til Santa</a>.
</p>

<p>
Or try the App Store’s No.1 
<a class="ident" href="https://apps.apple.com/gb/app/santa-voicemail/id586387813" target="_blank" 
   title="Santa Voicemail App">Santa Voicemail App</a>, letting children call Santa direct from his workshop.
</p>

<p>
Fancy a personalised message?  
Try my <a href="/santa-script-generator" target="_blank" title="Santa Script Generator">Santa Script Generator</a>, 
or the hilarious 
<a href="/poundland-self-service-till-santa-voice" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
   title="FREE Personalised Santa Message">Poundland Santa Till Voice</a>.
<br>
Or upgrade to a 
<a href="https://festivestudio.com/i/santaradio/personalised-video" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" 
   title="Personalised Santa Video">Personalised Santa Video</a>.
</p>4:T6b2,<h2>Santa Radio, <span class="ident">In the Air</span> & <span class="ident">On the Air</span></h2>
<p>
Santa Radio broadcasts 365 days a year direct from Santa’s workshop, the UK’s No.1 online 
<strong>Christmas radio station</strong>, packed with festive hits, brand-new releases and classic favourites.
</p>

<p>
Hosted by <a href="/the-official-voice-of-santa" target="_blank" class="isred" 
   title="Guy Harris, The Official Voice of Santa">Guy Harris</a>, 
the station brings festive fun, humour and heart-warming moments all year round.
</p>

<p>
Enjoy featured shows, celebrity guests and explore our 
<a href="https://www.santaradio.co.uk/mugshots/all" class="isred" target="_blank" 
   title="Celebrity Santa Radio Mug Shots" rel="noopener noreferrer">MUG SHOTS</a>, packed with famous faces spreading festive cheer.
</p>

<p>
Listen anywhere, on iOS, Apple TV, Amazon devices, TuneIn and more via 
<a href="https://www.santaradio.co.uk" target="_blank" title="Santa Radio" rel="noopener noreferrer">SantaRadio.co.uk</a>.  
Follow along for instant streaming.
</p>

<p>
Want something fun?  
Try my <a href="/santa-script-generator" class="isred" title="Santa Script Generator">Santa Script Generator</a>,  
or enjoy the hilarious 
<a href="https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/poundland-self-service-till-santa-voice" title="Poundland Santa Voice" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
Poundland Santa Till Voice</a>.
</p>

<p class="centre">
Want more?  
<a href="https://www.santaradio.co.uk" target="_blank" title="Listen Live on Santa Radio" rel="noopener noreferrer">
<strong>Listen Live on Santa Radio, The World’s Best Christmas Station</strong></a>
</p>7:T575,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","@id":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/santa-voice#faq","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Who is the best Santa voiceover artist in the UK?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Guy Harris is widely considered the UK's No.1 Voice of Santa, with credits for BBC Radio 1, BBC Radio 2, Heart, Capital, ITV, Asda, Tesco and Butlins."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I hire a Santa voice for my Christmas campaign?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Guy Harris provides professional Santa Claus voiceovers for TV, radio, digital campaigns, corporate events, personalised messages and more."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What does a Santa voiceover cost?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Pricing depends on usage and length. Most Santa voiceover projects start from £49.99 for web use. Contact Guy for a fast, no-obligation quote."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can Guy Harris do a live Santa voice at my event?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Guy Harris provides live Voice of Santa performances for grottos, shopping centres, corporate events and Christmas light switch-ons."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is this a real Santa voice or AI?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"This is a real human performance by professional British voice artist Guy Harris – not AI-generated."}}]}0:["T-vE3jocQsMrcy4PkMQjv",[[["",{"children":["santa-voice",{"children":["__PAGE__",{}]}]},"$undefined","$undefined",true],["",{"children":["santa-voice",{"children":["__PAGE__",{},[["$L1",["$","main",null,{"className":"inner-page","children":[["$","section",null,{"className":"inner-hero","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-container","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h1>The UK’s Leading <span class=\"ident\">Voice of Santa</span>, Ho Ho Ho!</h1>\r\n<p>\r\nAs the UK’s most in-demand Santa Claus voice, heard on BBC Radio 2, Capital, ITV, Heart Xmas and Santa Radio,\r\nI brin